Title: "Infix Command Expressions"
Id: "2a79f80e-9692-4c4e-a4d1-5feb20b52b81"

Text: "Infix command expressions place a command between two expressions using `\.` and `./`.

```mlg-fragment
A \.set.union./ B
P \.and./ Q
x \.less.than./ y
```

The command between `\.` and `./` is resolved like a command expression. Its documented `written:` template is used for rendering when available.

Infix command expressions have lower precedence than equality. This lets `x = a \.or./ x = b` parse as `(x = a) \.or./ (x = b)`."
Id: "c21424d8-d5cd-452c-83d2-c7d741101478"
